    "/api/v{version}/colonias/en-punto": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Colonias"
        ],
        "summary": "Colonia del punto o «fuera de cobertura» (200 en ambos casos). Las coordenadas se convierten en colonia y se descartan: no se\r\nguardan, no se registran, no se cachean y no vuelven en la respuesta. El 422 lo da `ValidationFilter` antes de esta acción.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "lat",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Latitude in decimal degrees, from -90 to 90, dot as decimal separator, up to 10 decimals. Exactly one value.",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "maxLength": 16,
              "pattern": "^-?\\d{1,3}(\\.\\d{1,10})?$",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "lon",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Longitude in decimal degrees, from -180 to 180, dot as decimal separator, up to 10 decimals. Exactly one value.",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "maxLength": 16,
              "pattern": "^-?\\d{1,3}(\\.\\d{1,10})?$",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "version",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OK",
            "content": {
              "text/plain": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NeighborhoodAtPointResponse"
                }
              },
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NeighborhoodAtPointResponse"
                }
              },
              "text/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NeighborhoodAtPointResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Unauthorized",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Unprocessable Entity",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Too Many Requests",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v{version}/oficios": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Oficios"
        ],
        "summary": "Oficios activos como arreglo sin paginar: excepción documentada a la constitución §11 (catálogo acotado, D9).\r\n`[AllowAnonymous]` explícito para que siga público aunque se agregue una política de autorización global (D3).",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "version",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OK",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OficioResponse"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "ConfirmedFileResponse": {
        "required": [
          "id",
          "estado",
          "ancho",
          "alto"
        ],
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "estado": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "ancho": {
            "pattern": "^-?(?:0|[1-9]\\d*)$",
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "string"
            ],
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "alto": {
            "pattern": "^-?(?:0|[1-9]\\d*)$",
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "string"
            ],
            "format": "int32"
          }
        }
      },
      "CreateUploadRequest": {
        "required": [
          "uso",
          "contentType",
          "tamanoBytes"
        ],
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "uso": {
            "type": [
              "null",
              "string"
            ]
          },
          "contentType": {
            "type": [
              "null",
              "string"
            ]
          },
          "tamanoBytes": {
            "pattern": "^-?(?:0|[1-9]\\d*)$",
            "type": [
              "null",
              "integer",
              "string"
            ],
            "format": "int64"
          }
        },
        "description": "Petición de subida: uso previsto, tipo y tamaño declarados. La forma la valida `CreateUploadRequestValidator`\r\n(422 con campos); tipo o tamaño no permitidos los rechaza el servicio (422)."
      },
      "FirebaseExchangeRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "firebaseIdToken": {
            "type": [
              "null",
              "string"
            ]
          },
          "deviceId": {
